      "content": "The Azure Logic Apps Management REST API exposes operations for managing workflows, runs, triggers, versions and integration accounts in the multitenant (Consumption) Logic Apps service. Operations are reached via the Azure Resource Manager endpoint and require an Azure AD bearer token along with subscription-scoped resource group and workflow path parameters.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Microsoft Azure",
